{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the heart of darkness with <strong>PHOTOBIA: Tales from the Dark</strong>, an indie puzzle game built around the manipulation of light and time. Explore shadowy labyrinths, uncover hidden secrets, and bend reality to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/d95f8b066ad1a2c6d8f3ac33a5cd4c42.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a universe where light becomes a tool of power, solve multidimensional puzzles and alter the flow of time to move beyond the unknown. Every reflection hides a clue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/554afeb939464f4206a6b7f32899b624.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with light to reshape your surroundings and use physics to your advantage. Overcome increasingly complex challenges in a world that constantly shifts around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/DirectionGif.gif?t=1751978020\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/SizeGif.gif?t=1751978020\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/2461294f7984ad2eac8b3322d980f50b.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transcend the boundaries of what\u2019s possible as you master the manipulation of space and time. Each puzzle offers a new opportunity to interact with a realm where reality bends to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/RewindGif.gif?t=1751978020\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/f3b60768e561eecbe7faa0d0d2c78e33.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient mystery lies hidden in the shadows. Progress through increasingly intricate levels, uncover fragments of truth, and unravel a riddle that transcends the very understanding of the dark realm.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world around you is collapsing. Traverse unstable labyrinths and use every skill at your disposal to stay one step ahead of reality\u2019s disintegration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is short and the shadows are more hostile than ever. Only those who master the manipulation of light will overcome the most extreme trials of this twisted realm.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permadeath</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No room for mistakes. A single misstep and the darkness will consume you forever. Face the most unforgiving challenge, where mercy does not exist.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock and compete with players from around the world. Sharpen your reflexes, master the light, and claim the title of ultimate speedrunner in the dark realm.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandbox</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your creativity in the Steam Workshop. Design new levels, share your creations, and explore community-made worlds in a universe that constantly expands.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Abandon all hope, ye who enter here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/7c7811ee6b09d9597b88865de67b88e5c28555a5.jpg"},{"name":"Architect of Realms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/bf850bda9a9b4fde1e4329e7ca2dea20532fe960.jpg"},{"name":"Unfinished Symphony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/af332323365f62d9a4ea62addcb17738bb32cabc.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/c676ea5d2daca1392b226932df28de6953f5b4fd.jpg"},{"name":"Spectral Mirage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/2bfc44bf02b4be5afc186780b5d5c5db948b47a2.jpg"},{"name":"Temporal Deadline","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/1c4ef01f2cc8b66307cb29f17f29cc461f5e83a8.jpg"},{"name":"Close Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/218bfc089ab3a281ab2485814b2e207d229753af.jpg"},{"name":"Veil Unbound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/3e80cad8117bf0a651fafe2fc14d26047ad36bf8.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Threshold of Eternity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2919230/b4582c69063becf3ecae70b3cd77ae72241cef13.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2919230?t=1751978020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751978020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/8c3fb2b778970ac1e69e0974c51b910b98fff793/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751978020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/8c3fb2b778970ac1e69e0974c51b910b98fff793/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751978020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3180250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the heart of darkness with <strong>PHOTOBIA: Tales from the Dark</strong>, an indie puzzle game built around the manipulation of light and time. Explore shadowy labyrinths, uncover hidden secrets, and bend reality to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/d95f8b066ad1a2c6d8f3ac33a5cd4c42.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a universe where light becomes a tool of power, solve multidimensional puzzles and alter the flow of time to move beyond the unknown. Every reflection hides a clue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/554afeb939464f4206a6b7f32899b624.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with light to reshape your surroundings and use physics to your advantage. Overcome increasingly complex challenges in a world that constantly shifts around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/DirectionGif.gif?t=1751978020\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/SizeGif.gif?t=1751978020\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/2461294f7984ad2eac8b3322d980f50b.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transcend the boundaries of what\u2019s possible as you master the manipulation of space and time. Each puzzle offers a new opportunity to interact with a realm where reality bends to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/RewindGif.gif?t=1751978020\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/extras/f3b60768e561eecbe7faa0d0d2c78e33.avif?t=1751978020\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient mystery lies hidden in the shadows. Progress through increasingly intricate levels, uncover fragments of truth, and unravel a riddle that transcends the very understanding of the dark realm.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world around you is collapsing. Traverse unstable labyrinths and use every skill at your disposal to stay one step ahead of reality\u2019s disintegration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is short and the shadows are more hostile than ever. Only those who master the manipulation of light will overcome the most extreme trials of this twisted realm.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permadeath</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No room for mistakes. A single misstep and the darkness will consume you forever. Face the most unforgiving challenge, where mercy does not exist.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock and compete with players from around the world. Sharpen your reflexes, master the light, and claim the title of ultimate speedrunner in the dark realm.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandbox</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your creativity in the Steam Workshop. Design new levels, share your creations, and explore community-made worlds in a universe that constantly expands.</p>","developers":["Simone Filippini"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919230/d273dbb65904ac7f0ab36cdbc981b9e3fdbc5dd0/header.jpg?t=1751978020","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257089888,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089888/movie480.mp4?t=1742576343","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089888/movie_max.mp4?t=1742576343"},"name":"Official Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257089888/786777687ad9cadb301a2cccb6341ddfe18f5663/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742576343","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089888/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742576343","max":"http://video.